// Workspace so `go build`/`go test ./...` and `go run ./test/proto-validate`
// span both the product module and the test-only proto-validate module. The
// split exists to keep protocompile out of the shipped module's dependency
// contract (see test/proto-validate/go.mod); the workspace is what keeps that
// split from costing anything at development or CI time.
go 1.27.0

use (
	.
	./test/proto-validate
)
